     <item>
      <widget class="QLabel" name="sensitivityLabel">
       <property name="font">
        <font>
         <pointsize>10</pointsize>
        </font>
       </property>
       <property name="toolTip">
        <string>How faint a print may be and still be considered.
• Range: 1 to 10
• Default: 5
• Lower values: only well-shadowed prints (sunny conditions), fastest
• Higher values: also faint prints (flat light, wind-filled tracks)
Every trail must still beat the chance of lining up random clutter, so higher values mostly cost processing time; very high values can add false trails in cluttered snow.</string>
       </property>
       <property name="text">
        <string>Sensitivity:</string>
       </property>
      </widget>
     </item>
