       <property name="toolTip">
        <string>Typical diameter of one footprint depression.
• Range: 5 to 100 cm
• Default: 30 cm (posthole in deep, soft snow)
Sets the size of dark spot the detector looks for. Boot prints in packed snow are about 20 cm;
deep postholes are 25-35 cm. Must be smaller than the minimum step length.</string>
       </property>
